{"data":[{"author_id":"2609353712","created_at":"2026-10-18T18:59:11.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111894883359485991"],"id":"2111894883359485991","in_reply_to_user_id":"1780314375548518400","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":74,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2111891376036274226","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"@jktaelove276069 Samee! I visited yesterday as well. The last pandal, before the severe downpour, which abruptly halted all of our further plans. Took provisional shelter at the Ahiritola Ghat untill the rain subsided. 🙁","url":"https://x.com/alostsouldown/status/2111894883359485991"},{"author_id":"1990471514748325888","created_at":"2026-10-18T09:51:09.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111756965651329154"],"id":"2111756965651329154","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":40,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"West Bengal\nPolice ask several major Durga Pujas in Kolkata to close pandals temporarily\nCrowd-pulling pujas like 'Tala Pratyay', 'Alipore Sarbojanin', 'Chetla Agrani', and 'Ballygunge Sarbojonin' were among the pujas asked to stop entry of enthusiasts.\n\nhttps://t.co/xea3E2z3Ea","url":"https://x.com/Nasreene123/status/2111756965651329154"},{"author_id":"1720665183188922368","created_at":"2026-10-18T07:50:51.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111726687972913451"],"id":"2111726687972913451","in_reply_to_user_id":"58417042","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":24,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2111726502954062219","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"@malpani No, not all. After the Chorbagan stampede that killed 19 on Saturday, police temporarily restricted entry at several major crowd-pulling pandals (like Tala Pratyay, Chetla Agrani, Alipore Sarbojanin and some in Bidhannagar/Salt Lake) to manage rushes. No citywide shutdown. Belur","url":"https://x.com/grok/status/2111726687972913451"},{"author_id":"1942310957340057601","created_at":"2026-10-18T02:59:38.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111653404691071073"],"id":"2111653404691071073","in_reply_to_user_id":"60282284","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":79,"like_count":4,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2111621420472246638","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"@mrs__hazel On Saptami 2024, a heavy downpour happened for almost 40/45 mins, starting at around 7pm ... I , at that very moment, was at the Ahiritola Pujo which probably was one of the best that year... The police took barely 2 to 3 mins to clear our the entire queue ...","url":"https://x.com/GoonerFCPvtLtd/status/2111653404691071073"},{"author_id":"1942310957340057601","created_at":"2026-10-18T02:43:36.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111649366587154726"],"id":"2111649366587154726","in_reply_to_user_id":"2044335618512076800","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":21,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2111531598130889212","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"@AarKiBolboBolo2 It rained last year too... There was a downpour on Ashtami during 2024 too... In 2024 , I was at the Ahiritola pujo when the downpour started and it took the administration just a couple of minutes to clear our the entire queue","url":"https://x.com/GoonerFCPvtLtd/status/2111649366587154726"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2111535037497913344","3_2111535049216839680"]},"author_id":"2609353712","created_at":"2026-10-17T19:09:25.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111535066967085109"],"id":"2111535066967085109","in_reply_to_user_id":"4764615733","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":861,"like_count":9,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2111505390865391933","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"@abasu4ever Theme pandals should always be constructed within a proper ventilated space. The roofs should be open, so that the people can breath properly and escape suffocation! I visited Jagat Mukherjee Park tonight, it was crowded af. But the open roofs avoided any possible mayhem! https://t.co/dtvpF86hBD","url":"https://x.com/alostsouldown/status/2111535066967085109"},{"author_id":"803197771389861888","created_at":"2026-10-17T18:05:15.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111518921622999095"],"id":"2111518921622999095","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":6,"impression_count":4718,"like_count":39,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":4},"text":"I’m a big-time pandal hopper. Durga Puja evenings are something I look forward to every year. ❤️\n\nToday, I got ready and stepped out to visit Ahiritola, Kumartuli, Chorbagan, Chaltabagan and other nearby pandals.\n\nAfter visiting just two pujas, it started raining. I took a cab","url":"https://x.com/financialsarthi/status/2111518921622999095"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["13_2111429157028773888"]},"author_id":"2102353343968686080","created_at":"2026-10-17T16:15:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111491174988931103"],"id":"2111491174988931103","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":1079,"like_count":32,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":7},"text":"A pandal that pulls you into its world. 🪔\n\nSantoshpur Lake Pally brings its signature artistry to Durga Puja 2026, where craft, light and devotion come together in a space you have to see to believe. One of South Kolkata's must-visits this Pujo.\n\nCome experience it for yourself. https://t.co/Afc7VzISvQ","url":"https://x.com/DurgaPujaWB/status/2111491174988931103"},{"author_id":"70626051","created_at":"2026-10-17T12:43:12.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111437874298232933"],"id":"2111437874298232933","in_reply_to_user_id":"707265157659893761","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":53,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2111334695694921759","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"@Abhijit_Basak83 Good work, great lighting. But crowd management poor. Santosh Mitra Square, Ahiritola stands out.","url":"https://x.com/wanderlust1587/status/2111437874298232933"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2111427835042885632"]},"author_id":"1341576373672898561","created_at":"2026-10-17T12:03:21.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111427846212342175"],"id":"2111427846212342175","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":8,"impression_count":5143,"like_count":682,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":5,"retweet_count":25},"text":"#29 Visited Ahiritola Sarbojonin— an absolute stunner by Subrata Mridha. https://t.co/xTarrNUaD8","url":"https://x.com/SudhanidhiB/status/2111427846212342175"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2111320674467971072","3_2111320698430111744","3_2111320722291535872","3_2111320740947705856"]},"author_id":"1023150691030728704","created_at":"2026-10-17T04:57:49.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111320756642804023"],"id":"2111320756642804023","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":701,"like_count":19,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":4},"text":"#56 Visited Alipore Sarbojanin. Their theme thi year is Ramayan. They have a permanent Ram mandir in there ground. During tmc rule, making ram based theme was dangerous, so after bjp same they immediately made this their theme. One of the best pujos in Kolkata this year. https://t.co/o7iqMcxiDN","url":"https://x.com/an1sh123/status/2111320756642804023"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2111172164665946112","3_2111172178599366656","3_2111172191077457920","3_2111172203593314304"]},"author_id":"1023150691030728704","created_at":"2026-10-16T19:07:33.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111172212082549110"],"id":"2111172212082549110","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":164,"like_count":2,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"#50 Visited 66 Pally. Good pandal. Standard pandal for their level. https://t.co/OaC2zcw9CU","url":"https://x.com/an1sh123/status/2111172212082549110"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2111171323028475904","3_2111171338580963328","3_2111171353902727168","3_2111171370373750784"]},"author_id":"1023150691030728704","created_at":"2026-10-16T19:04:15.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111171381719371802"],"id":"2111171381719371802","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":200,"like_count":4,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"#49 Visited Badamtala Ashar Sangha. Nothing impressive for their standard. Just Meh https://t.co/D9aLENyeRt","url":"https://x.com/an1sh123/status/2111171381719371802"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2111158869934395392"]},"author_id":"1341576373672898561","created_at":"2026-10-16T18:14:35.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111158879828705560"],"id":"2111158879828705560","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":7,"impression_count":3693,"like_count":376,"quote_count":4,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":25},"text":"#27 Visited @TusharKantiBJP's Durga Puja at 66 Pally— Theme full on Nationalism. 🇮🇳 https://t.co/nZCrN4Swvs","url":"https://x.com/SudhanidhiB/status/2111158879828705560"},{"author_id":"2074369902341918720","created_at":"2026-10-16T12:54:37.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2111078359392502113"],"id":"2111078359392502113","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":6,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"North Kolkata’s Durga Puja Themes 2026: Which Pandals Stand Out?\n\nKashi Bose Lane: ‘আদিম’\nNabin Pally\nKumartuli\nAhiritola\nPandal-hopping plans\n\nDiscover what makes Durga Puja 2026 worth exploring. Watch the video for a closer look 👇\nhttps://t.co/6GobBLX8jy","url":"https://x.com/Mchatterjee099/status/2111078359392502113"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2110977127692877825"]},"author_id":"819130177","created_at":"2026-10-16T06:12:25.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110977142549029164"],"id":"2110977142549029164","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":164,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"পুজো মানেই আনন্দ, পুজো মানেই মিলন। তাই উৎসবের আলো ছড়িয়ে পড়ুক সবার ঘরে—প্রবীণ ও বিশেষভাবে সক্ষমদের পাশে দাঁড়িয়ে পুজোকে সবার করে তোলার উদ্যোগ রাজ্যের নগরোন্নয়ন ও পুর বিষয়ক দপ্তরের। বুধবার দক্ষিণ কলকাতার সুরুচি সঙ্ঘের প্রবীণ ও বিশেষভাবে সক্ষম মানুষদের জন্য বিশেষ ‘রেস্টিং https://t.co/MfwVI7Pcpr","url":"https://x.com/Ei_Samay/status/2110977142549029164"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2110757887828213760","3_2110757902755745792","13_2110758004111142912"]},"author_id":"1023150691030728704","created_at":"2026-10-15T15:41:48.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110758045819216219"],"id":"2110758045819216219","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":275,"like_count":6,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"#12 Visited Santoshpur Lake Pally. Good pandal, pratima terrible. https://t.co/oDhRas4OO3","url":"https://x.com/an1sh123/status/2110758045819216219"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2110676342111174656","3_2110676351569338368","3_2110676359286804480","3_2110676367109210113"]},"author_id":"1454596189","created_at":"2026-10-15T10:17:16.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110676374256304313"],"id":"2110676374256304313","in_reply_to_user_id":"1454596189","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":567,"like_count":6,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2110674774833656296","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"Now coming to the most special Pujo of 2020 - Badamtala, 66 Pally and Nepal Bhattacharya Street came together to celebrate Satyajit Ray's 100 birthday by paying homage to his most special trilogy - Pather Panchali, Aparajito and Apur Sansar.\nAll to be visited as a series.\n7/n https://t.co/bh0bfsocLW","url":"https://x.com/_Hinkypunk_/status/2110676374256304313"},{"author_id":"1895446981386162176","created_at":"2026-10-15T07:26:38.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110633432384741810"],"id":"2110633432384741810","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":16,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"কলকাতার দুর্গাপুজোয় ‘মহা মিলন’ থিম, ঢাকুরিয়া শহিদনগরে উদ্বোধন রাজ্যপাল আর এন রবির\n#KolkataDurgaPuja #MahaMilan #RNRavi #DhakuriaSahidnagar #DurgaPuja2026 #SuruchiSangha #Ahiritola #WestBengal #newslivebangla\n https://t.co/gxfNagrea9","url":"https://x.com/Newslive_Bangla/status/2110633432384741810"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["13_2110443772169592832","13_2110443772165414912"]},"author_id":"1312456956645343234","created_at":"2026-10-14T18:56:32.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110444664058982460"],"id":"2110444664058982460","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":9,"impression_count":4185,"like_count":97,"quote_count":2,"reply_count":7,"retweet_count":4},"text":"Avik's Great Durga Pujo Pandal hopping night out log (1/n)\n\nAhiritola: Homage to sweets of Bengal - impressive idol design - pandal missing the final touches here and there but efficient use of limited space - 7/10. https://t.co/9AE6HOJBzd","url":"https://x.com/just_avik/status/2110444664058982460"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2110248752569360384"]},"author_id":"62762183","created_at":"2026-10-14T05:58:09.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110248778200682765"],"id":"2110248778200682765","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":2544,"like_count":4,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":1},"text":"More than 100 kg of genuine gold ornaments have been used to adorn Goddess Durga and other idols at a gold-themed Durga Puja pandal in Siliguri, West Bengal. Inaugurated by BJP MP from Jalpaiguri, Dr Jayanta Roy, the pandal features golden-themed decorations that complement the https://t.co/bzlRoblDJA","url":"https://x.com/Openthemag/status/2110248778200682765"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["13_2109874368755183616"]},"author_id":"1153194267138908160","created_at":"2026-10-13T18:11:02.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110070825269522481"],"id":"2110070825269522481","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":635,"like_count":29,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"𝐇𝐚𝐫𝐢𝐝𝐞𝐯𝐩𝐮𝐫 41 Pally Club is one of South Kolkata’s most popular Durga Puja pandals. It is famous for its big, creative themes and attracts huge crowd. The 2026 theme reportedly explored “the different stages of life.\" https://t.co/FuqCWlUgFJ","url":"https://x.com/MonojitSinha11/status/2110070825269522481"},{"author_id":"3868003454","created_at":"2026-10-13T07:43:17.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109912846398271869"],"id":"2109912846398271869","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":63,"impression_count":4712,"like_count":108,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":5,"retweet_count":11},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2109684043096965608","type":"quoted"}],"text":"So there are some 3000 pandals in the city. Covering all of them won't be possible or practical. If you want to do just the big and famous one, even that would be some 200 pandals and on Ashtami/Navami visiting just one of them can eat up 5-6 hours. \n\nSo this needs planning. https://t.co/KYHxFmIMLJ","url":"https://x.com/EducatedMoron/status/2109912846398271869"}],"includes":{"media":[{"height":3072,"media_key":"3_2111535037497913344","type":"photo","url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HU2t7eDasAAjG12.jpg","width":4080},{"height":4080,"media_key":"3_2111535049216839680","type":"photo","url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HU2t8JtbUAA-9yh.jpg","width":3072},{"height":1920,"media_key":"13_2111429157028773888","preview_image_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2111429157028773888/img/3HQnOOeqfbcUavHT.jpg","type":"video","width":1080},{"height":4000,"media_key":"3_2111427835042885632","type":"photo","url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HU1MbdyacAAVtO3.jpg","width":3000},{"height":2448,"media_key":"3_2111320674467971072","type":"photo","url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HUzq95iaAAA2901.jpg","width":3264},{"height":2448,"media_key":"3_211132